Don't know.

> Do I still get carry bonuses if I put my blessed luckstone in a bag of
> holding?  How about the Eye of the Aethiopica? (I find I prefer to
> wear AoLS.)

No. Only things in your inventory can affect you in any way (well, things
in your bags do affect you in that they count towards your carrying
capacity, of course).

By the way, the Eye has several effects, some of which will work if you
just carry it with you (confers magic resistance and faster energy
regeneration; half damage when attacked by spells), some only if you
actually *wear* it (ESP).

